  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"width: 315px; border-spacing: 2px; text-align: left; font-size: 90%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Second Vietnam War\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Part of Mexican-American Proxy Wars\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 90%; border-bottom: 1px solid #aaa; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/1a/2nd_Vietnam_War.png/revision/latest?cb=20170215051900\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"2nd Vietnam War\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/1a/2nd_Vietnam_War.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/270?cb=20170215051900\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"270\" height=\"404\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"2nd Vietnam War.png\" data-image-key=\"2nd_Vietnam_War.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span><br />Map of the War's Belligerents in 2105\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"infobox\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin: 0; cellpadding: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Date\n</th>\n<td>February 2, 2102- April 4, 2106\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Location\n</th>\n<td>Vietnam\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Causes\n</th>\n<td>Vietnamese Military Coup d'état\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Result\n</th>\n<td>Military stalemate\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Belligerents\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<p><b><span class=\"new\" title=\"U.S. Allies of the Third Mexican War (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVS5TLl9BbGxpZXNfb2ZfdGhlX1RoaXJkX01leGljYW5fV2FyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\"> United States-Allies</span></b>\n</p><p><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e4/US_flag_81smallstars.png/revision/latest?cb=20150810065423\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"US flag 81smallstars\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e4/US_flag_81smallstars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150810065423\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"US flag 81smallstars.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_81smallstars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/United_States_of_America\" title=\"United States of America\">United States</a><br />\n<span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/01/Flag_of_China_%282058-2108%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20150815025944\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of China (2058-2108)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/01/Flag_of_China_%282058-2108%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150815025944\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of China (2058-2108).png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_China_%282058-2108%29.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/United_Federation_of_China\" title=\"United Federation of China\">China</a><br />\n<span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/3/3e/Cham_Flag.png/revision/latest?cb=20170215052436\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Cham Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cham Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Cham_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/3/3e/Cham_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20170215052436\" /></a></span> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Champa\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wp:Champa\">Champa</a><br />\n<span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/b/b1/National_Vietnamese_Army.png/revision/latest?cb=20170215052654\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"National Vietnamese Army\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"National Vietnamese Army.png\" data-image-key=\"National_Vietnamese_Army.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/b/b1/National_Vietnamese_Army.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20170215052654\" /></a></span> National Vietnamese Army\n</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<p><b><span class=\"new\" title=\"Mexican Allies of the Third Mexican War (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTWV4aWNhbl9BbGxpZXNfb2ZfdGhlX1RoaXJkX01leGljYW5fV2FyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\"> Mexican-Allies</span></b>\n</p><p><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/ea/Flag_of_Vietnam.png/revision/latest?cb=20170215053202\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of Vietnam\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Vietnam.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Vietnam.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/ea/Flag_of_Vietnam.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20170215053202\" /></a></span> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vietnam\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wp:Vietnam\">Vietnam</a><b><br /></b>\n<span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/7/7c/Flag_of_the_Khmer_Republic.png/revision/latest?cb=20170215053051\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of the Khmer Republic\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of the Khmer Republic.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_the_Khmer_Republic.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/7/7c/Flag_of_the_Khmer_Republic.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20170215053051\" /></a></span> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khmer_Republic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wp:Khmer Republic\">Khmer Republic</a>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><small><b>Military Support:</b></small><br />\n<span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/25/Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20151031154418\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of Mexico (2074)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Mexico (2074).png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/25/Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20151031154418\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mexico\" title=\"Mexico\">Mexico</a><b><br /></b>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Commanders\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<p><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e4/US_flag_81smallstars.png/revision/latest?cb=20150810065423\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"US flag 81smallstars\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"US flag 81smallstars.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_81smallstars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e4/US_flag_81smallstars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150810065423\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tom_Steele\" title=\"Tom Steele\">Tom Steele</a><br />\n</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<p><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/25/Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20151031154418\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of Mexico (2074)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Mexico (2074).png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/25/Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20151031154418\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Luis_Zepeda\" title=\"Luis Zepeda\">Luis Zepeda</a><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p><p>The <b>Second Vietnam War</b> was a protracted armed conflict that began in 2102 with the invasion of Vietnam by the United States-led coalition to restore the democratically elected government of Nguyen Tan Luong. The conflict continued until the 2106 Taipei Peace Talks divided the country and declared a ceasefire, though the conflict was technically still ongoing until the Third Mexican-American War ended.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Background\">Background</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSecond_Vietnam_War%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"clear:right; float:right; width:15.0em; margin-left:1.0em; padding:0.2em; border:1px solid #000000; background:#f2f2f2; font-size:90%; text-align:center; line-height:1.4em;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:white; font-size:85%; line-height:1.8em;\">\n<div style=\"padding-bottom:0.25em;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/90/Cold_War_Logo.png/revision/latest?cb=20171018054154\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Cold War Logo\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cold War Logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Cold_War_Logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/90/Cold_War_Logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20171018054154\" /></a></span></div>\n<p>Part of <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Mexican-American_Cold_War\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Mexican-American Cold War\">a series</a> on the<br />\n<span style=\"font-size:125%;\"><b>History of the <a href=\"/wiki/Mexican-American_Cold_War\" title=\"Mexican-American Cold War\">Mexican-American Cold War</a></b></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding:0.2em 0.5em; background:#ccf;\">Origins\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0.2em 0.5em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Second_Depression\" title=\"Second Depression\">Second Depression</a><br /><small>(<a href=\"/wiki/Oscar_Lachman\" title=\"Oscar Lachman\">Mass Deportations</a>)</small><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Second_Mexican-American_War\" title=\"Second Mexican-American War\">Second Mexican War</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_of_America\" title=\"United States of America\">US-Allies</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Latin_American_Union\" title=\"Latin American Union\">Latin American Union</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Interplanetary_Trade_Commission\" title=\"Interplanetary Trade Commission\">Interplanetary Trade Commission</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding:0.2em 0.5em; background:#ccf;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Second Vietnam War</strong>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding:0.2em 0.5em; background:#ccf;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Third_Chinese_Civil_War\" title=\"Third Chinese Civil War\">Third Chinese Civil War</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding:0.2em 0.5em; background:#ccf;\"><a href=\"/wiki/India_Crisis\" title=\"India Crisis\">India Crisis</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding:0.2em 0.5em; background:#ccf;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sahara_War\" title=\"Sahara War\">Sahara War</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding:0.2em 0.5em; background:#ccf;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Battle_of_Brazil\" title=\"Battle of Brazil\">Battle of Brazil</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding:0.2em 0.5em; background:#ccf;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Third_Mexican-American_War\" title=\"Third Mexican-American War\">Third Mexican War</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Timeline_of_major_events\" title=\"Timeline of major events\">Timeline</a> &#160;<b>&#183;</b>&#32; <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Mexican-American_Cold_War\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Mexican-American Cold War\">Conflicts</a>\n</th></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>In 2101 Vietnam held the most contentious election in its history. Nguyen Tan Luong was a reformer who called for Vietnam to adopt the Quantum Economic Model, much as its neighbor China was attempting to do, and unite the East in a common market. Luong was opposed by candidates backed by Mexico, who were vehemently opposed to the QEM. Luong narrowly won the election, leading to riots across the country's northern territories. Luong was captured in a military coup shortly after taking office, and a Junta was put in place that called for new elections. The US supported Luong's election and Mexico supported the claims by the Junta that Luong was a dangerous radical.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Course_of_the_War\">Course of the War</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSecond_Vietnam_War%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The US formed a coalition with China, the Philippines, Thailand, and Indonesia to invade and return Luong to office and restore order while Mexican operators distributed weapons and armor to fuel the Junta's resistance and predicted sectarian conflict. The US-backed coalition invaded in February 2102.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Aftermath\">Aftermath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSecond_Vietnam_War%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After the end of the Second Vietnam War, many Chinese soldiers returned home to not only find their economy still devoid of opportunities, but the Federalist government delaying pensions for veterans. The whole situation was a&#160;powder&#160;keg, and Mexico was quick to exploit it for their own benefit. After making contacts with local&#160;regionalists, Mexican&#160;operatives quickly established separatists movements from within local Chinese Army regiments. With a little social engineering, all of Southern China was quickly in open revolt against the Federalist government in Beijing. The revolts in the South eventually became a coup de tat that forced the Americans to invade and pacify the Chinese capital. After&#160;a short, but costly civil war, some order began to be restored by 2108 and a provisional republic governed from American-run Shanghai had been propped up. Taiwan and Manchuria were in open rebellion, but not by Mexican sponsored revolutionaries, but revolts from local governments who refused to submit to a government so incapable of keeping the country in one piece.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261115211611\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 291/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8323/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5576/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.755      1 -total\n 64.18%    5.619      1 Template:Infobox_Military_Conflict\n 35.18%    3.080      1 Template:History_of_the_Mexican-American_Cold_War\n 22.21%    1.945      8 Template:WPMILHIST_Infobox_style\n 14.19%    1.242      1 Template:·\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:1373-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!L